OL,3,ARobert Bush lodges bid to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumberside Police said it had been
OL,7,Fnotified by the Criminal Appeal Office
OL,8,Fat the Royal Courts of Justice and
OL,9,Fadded "any decision regarding the
OL,10,Fappeal will be a matter for the
OL,11,Fcourts".
